  "contract_scope": [
    "Lazy/Proxy plus SetUp with constructor enabled and NoConstructor: two consecutive get failures, original ResolutionException target serviceId/previous null, no target constructor/setup/destructor; same container id then uses eager ClassDefinition, ignores class attributes, shares one constructed target and releases it with exactly one destructor.",
    "Make plus Proxy on property and parameter around a registered opaque product factory: two failures without factory or target lifecycle effects; ordinary get of that product factory still creates and shares its own product without interpreting class-level Proxy/SetUp.",
    "Backed Lazy/Proxy controls: creation and shared get defer lifecycle; first property access performs constructor then setup or setup alone under NoConstructor; repeated access does not repeat lifecycle; exactly one destructor on release.",
    "Custom ProxyFactoryInterface protocol double: standalone Container passes propertyless target class and callbacks to selected custom implementation and returns its identity. Test controls callback execution and verifies callback targets/backing result. It is not a claim that this double implements a complete alternate lazy runtime."
  ],
